    {
      "id": "evidence-000-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "Order-1 certificate in n with m symbolic. The base case at n = 0 collapses to the single point k = 0 by the parameter-free factors Gamma(k+1)^-2 (k >= 0) and Gamma(n-k+1)^-1 at n = 0 (k <= 0); the remaining Gamma powers cancel to the rational 1, matching C(m+0,0) = 1. Every other window point is checked to vanish.",
        "type": "prose"
      },
